{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casino Resort Tower</strong> is about building a casino resort skyscraper that comes alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t just build rooms.<br>You design a world where people live, work, wait, relax, get annoyed, recover, and move on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guests don\u2019t pass through your tower \u2014 they experience it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And those experiences quietly shape everything that happens next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the tower flows beautifully.<br>Sometimes it spirals into chaos.<br>And every time, it\u2019s your design that started the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8330d276248e5618e76fe0d6e75a3a40.poster.avif?t=1770989222\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8330d276248e5618e76fe0d6e75a3a40.webm?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8330d276248e5618e76fe0d6e75a3a40.mp4?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/c30bdf3dc88a8bcde0d2eb4115b15082.poster.avif?t=1770989222\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/c30bdf3dc88a8bcde0d2eb4115b15082.webm?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/c30bdf3dc88a8bcde0d2eb4115b15082.mp4?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/0b9d1e52866f94e3cc5631183d267299.poster.avif?t=1770989222\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/0b9d1e52866f94e3cc5631183d267299.webm?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/0b9d1e52866f94e3cc5631183d267299.mp4?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Design Creates Moments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hallway, elevator, lounge, and staff room you place changes the emotional tone of the space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy break room lifts morale.<br>A cramped corridor builds tension.<br>A long wait can turn excitement into frustration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People react to your layout in real time \u2014<br>moving, queuing, resting, complaining, recovering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/ffdf7db4436468aea2b62896c7aa36d7.poster.avif?t=1770989222\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/ffdf7db4436468aea2b62896c7aa36d7.webm?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/ffdf7db4436468aea2b62896c7aa36d7.mp4?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/31d09044d808f91e73d33b0eebfde59f.poster.avif?t=1770989222\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/31d09044d808f91e73d33b0eebfde59f.webm?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/31d09044d808f91e73d33b0eebfde59f.mp4?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/dec6ddf9a13a85bfdd1abbeb1fc2da34.poster.avif?t=1770989222\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/dec6ddf9a13a85bfdd1abbeb1fc2da34.webm?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/dec6ddf9a13a85bfdd1abbeb1fc2da34.mp4?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep, Not Punishing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casino Resort Tower is not a casual idle game \u2014 <br>it\u2019s a deep simulation about cause and effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it\u2019s also forgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small mistakes create ripples, not dead ends. <br>Big failures become your most satisfying comebacks. <br>The tower doesn\u2019t collapse \u2014 it adapts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re encouraged to experiment, fail, and discover how your world truly works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/3880ea1bfe484f562280fe9f64414c71.poster.avif?t=1770989222\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/3880ea1bfe484f562280fe9f64414c71.webm?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/3880ea1bfe484f562280fe9f64414c71.mp4?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/fa873798b53d43272d3147301294a4b4.poster.avif?t=1770989222\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/fa873798b53d43272d3147301294a4b4.webm?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/fa873798b53d43272d3147301294a4b4.mp4?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8e56af964a7530545563961f5c2f3a71.poster.avif?t=1770989222\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8e56af964a7530545563961f5c2f3a71.webm?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8e56af964a7530545563961f5c2f3a71.mp4?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>When Chaos Hits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elevators jam.<br>Staff get overwhelmed.<br>Guests react to the environment you created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tower starts to push back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step in, change the flow, add space, reroute movement \u2014<br>and watch the mood shift in real time as the tower finds its balance again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tower becomes a system under pressure \u2014<br>and you\u2019re the one rewriting its rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build it.<br>Break it.<br>Bring it back stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/4e22922668d2e20c06ff53f8703650df.poster.avif?t=1770989222\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/4e22922668d2e20c06ff53f8703650df.webm?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/4e22922668d2e20c06ff53f8703650df.mp4?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casino Resort Tower is in Early Access and continues to evolve with its community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every major update expands how your tower lives, reacts, and tells its stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":" Master of Mixology","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/84143ea572016029ca4ee757cdbb487f2f15fa56.jpg"},{"name":"Latte Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/813a50dc397d14ebfe70b43ce4572344f39c26ba.jpg"},{"name":"Chilled to Perfection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/2eb516425f569e4577e896f71a09e60e2ed752d0.jpg"},{"name":"Hotshot Brewer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/85eba3625d3628afac5f3a5e7a6f8699aad5351b.jpg"},{"name":"Mini-Bar Magnate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/8b594c388b397a9cc59dedb47c991800f7a85a17.jpg"},{"name":"Kitchen Conqueror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/dbee0fc07e863f814fe5e03ef3108923a415fa33.jpg"},{"name":"All-Nighter Empire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/efaa96378f3bdf788b24259bf8734b43623a696c.jpg"},{"name":"Snack Overlord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/58064ec06f584f593eb2425ff42276c17b73eafc.jpg"},{"name":"Cloud Commander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/8da40f6f6424a7781473b10011288e2164dc1c3d.jpg"},{"name":"Vendor Virtuoso","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/c4312b11257b0997e23d80edb0c7a5397e18e2c6.jpg"}],"total":74},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1457030?t=1770989222","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/688cc0306f8db251bc23fddb89ef15ae51ba9e79/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770989222","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/8f26f2b2acfef74cf2fb932830fa26eb1ffd98ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770989222","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/8f26f2b2acfef74cf2fb932830fa26eb1ffd98ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770989222","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>THE ROADMAP</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/3f19d4c316e2cbfc0437788b76141941.avif?t=1770989222\" width=780 height=2386 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casino Resort Tower</strong> is about building a casino resort skyscraper that comes alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t just build rooms.<br>You design a world where people live, work, wait, relax, get annoyed, recover, and move on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guests don\u2019t pass through your tower \u2014 they experience it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And those experiences quietly shape everything that happens next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the tower flows beautifully.<br>Sometimes it spirals into chaos.<br>And every time, it\u2019s your design that started the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8330d276248e5618e76fe0d6e75a3a40.poster.avif?t=1770989222\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8330d276248e5618e76fe0d6e75a3a40.webm?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8330d276248e5618e76fe0d6e75a3a40.mp4?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/c30bdf3dc88a8bcde0d2eb4115b15082.poster.avif?t=1770989222\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/c30bdf3dc88a8bcde0d2eb4115b15082.webm?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/c30bdf3dc88a8bcde0d2eb4115b15082.mp4?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/0b9d1e52866f94e3cc5631183d267299.poster.avif?t=1770989222\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/0b9d1e52866f94e3cc5631183d267299.webm?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/0b9d1e52866f94e3cc5631183d267299.mp4?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Design Creates Moments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hallway, elevator, lounge, and staff room you place changes the emotional tone of the space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy break room lifts morale.<br>A cramped corridor builds tension.<br>A long wait can turn excitement into frustration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People react to your layout in real time \u2014<br>moving, queuing, resting, complaining, recovering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/ffdf7db4436468aea2b62896c7aa36d7.poster.avif?t=1770989222\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/ffdf7db4436468aea2b62896c7aa36d7.webm?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/ffdf7db4436468aea2b62896c7aa36d7.mp4?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/31d09044d808f91e73d33b0eebfde59f.poster.avif?t=1770989222\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/31d09044d808f91e73d33b0eebfde59f.webm?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/31d09044d808f91e73d33b0eebfde59f.mp4?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/dec6ddf9a13a85bfdd1abbeb1fc2da34.poster.avif?t=1770989222\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/dec6ddf9a13a85bfdd1abbeb1fc2da34.webm?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/dec6ddf9a13a85bfdd1abbeb1fc2da34.mp4?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep, Not Punishing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casino Resort Tower is not a casual idle game \u2014 <br>it\u2019s a deep simulation about cause and effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it\u2019s also forgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small mistakes create ripples, not dead ends. <br>Big failures become your most satisfying comebacks. <br>The tower doesn\u2019t collapse \u2014 it adapts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re encouraged to experiment, fail, and discover how your world truly works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/3880ea1bfe484f562280fe9f64414c71.poster.avif?t=1770989222\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/3880ea1bfe484f562280fe9f64414c71.webm?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/3880ea1bfe484f562280fe9f64414c71.mp4?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/fa873798b53d43272d3147301294a4b4.poster.avif?t=1770989222\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/fa873798b53d43272d3147301294a4b4.webm?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/fa873798b53d43272d3147301294a4b4.mp4?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8e56af964a7530545563961f5c2f3a71.poster.avif?t=1770989222\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8e56af964a7530545563961f5c2f3a71.webm?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8e56af964a7530545563961f5c2f3a71.mp4?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>When Chaos Hits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elevators jam.<br>Staff get overwhelmed.<br>Guests react to the environment you created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tower starts to push back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step in, change the flow, add space, reroute movement \u2014<br>and watch the mood shift in real time as the tower finds its balance again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tower becomes a system under pressure \u2014<br>and you\u2019re the one rewriting its rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build it.<br>Break it.<br>Bring it back stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/4e22922668d2e20c06ff53f8703650df.poster.avif?t=1770989222\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/4e22922668d2e20c06ff53f8703650df.webm?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/4e22922668d2e20c06ff53f8703650df.mp4?t=1770989222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casino Resort Tower is in Early Access and continues to evolve with its community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every major update expands how your tower lives, reacts, and tells its stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Cyperk Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/b2e2968294785efa0acaa125763e0078efba7d3a/header.jpg?t=1770989222","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright\u00a9 2026 Cyperk Software | All rights reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<